@startuml GateKeeper DFD Level 0 - Context Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundcorner 10

title GateKeeper System - Context Diagram (Level 0)

actor "RAG Application" as RAG
actor "Policy Author\n(Studio)" as Author
actor "Auditor" as Auditor
actor "System Administrator" as Admin

rectangle "GateKeeper\nPolicy Enforcement System" as GK {
}

' Data flows from RAG Application
RAG --> GK : Enforcement Request\n(stage, user, request, artifacts)
GK --> RAG : Enforcement Response\n(decision, data, trace, policyContext)

' Data flows from Policy Author
Author --> GK : Policy Definition\n(name, stage, when, action)
Author --> GK : Schema Descriptor\n(user_attributes, doc_metadata)
GK --> Author : Validation Results\n(errors, warnings)
GK --> Author : Policy Test Results\n(passed, failed)

' Data flows from Auditor
Auditor --> GK : Audit Query\n(timeframe, filters)
GK --> Auditor : Audit Reports\n(decisions, traces, metrics)

' Data flows from System Administrator
Admin --> GK : Configuration\n(settings, tenant setup)
GK --> Admin : System Status\n(health, metrics)

note right of GK
  **GateKeeper System**
  - Policy enforcement at 4 stages
  - Multi-tenant support
  - Audit logging
  - Policy validation
end note

@enduml

